 · #94","image":"/img/scene-clips/7383.webp","imageBytes":10416,"video":"/videos/scene-clips/7383.mp4","videoBytes":89747,"duration":4.041667},"23229ccaff30":{"text":"Night is from sunset to sunrise.","id":"23229ccaff30","source":"BTS 9 · #86","image":"/img/scene-clips/7397.webp","imageBytes":13918,"video":"/videos/scene-clips/7397.mp4","videoBytes":73067,"duration":4.041667},"ade64bef44bc":{"text":"Twilight is between day and night.","id":"ade64bef44bc","source":"BTS 9 · #89","image":"/img/scene-clips/7449.webp","imageBytes":6516,"video":"/videos/scene-clips/7449.mp4","videoBytes":49648,"duration":4.041667}},"examples":["Can you see the constellations?","The sun rises in the morning.","When can you see the moon?","The day is divided into morning, afternoon, and evening.","In the afternoon the sun is high in the sky.","The sun sets in the evening.","The moon comes out at night.","Night is from sunset to sunrise.","I eat breakfast at seven thirty.","I go to school at eight o'clock.","I study at school in the afternoon.","I do my homework in the evening.","I take a shower before bed.","I go to sleep at nine o'clock.","Do you wake up early?","Good morning! How did you sleep?","Good night! Sweet dreams!","What time do you get up?","Yes, I always eat breakfast.","I eat cereal and milk.","The stars come out at night.","Is it daytime or nighttime?","How long is your nap?","The day is very long in summer.","The day is very short in winter.","Night is dark and quiet.","The day is bright and busy.","Dusk is when the sun starts to set.","The sun sets around seven o'clock.","I like to watch the sunrise.","The sunset is very beautiful.","Do you have a bedtime?","What time do you come home from school?","Do you do your homework right away?","No, I rest first.","What time do you have dinner?","Do you watch TV at night?","Sometimes, I watch TV before bed.","How many hours do you sleep?","Can you see the sky clearly?","Yes, it is a clear night.","Yes, there are some clouds.","The sunset is colorful.","I wake up early on weekends.","I stay up late on Fridays.","My nap is about one hour.","The day has twenty-four hours.","A minute has sixty seconds.","An hour has sixty minutes.","What is your daily schedule?","Do you have free time?","I read books or play games.","Dawn is when the sun starts to rise.","Twilight is between day and night.","It is getting dark outside.","It is getting light outside.","The sun is very bright today.","The moon is very bright tonight.","What time do you usually wake up?","Do you use an alarm clock?","What is your favorite time of day?"]}
